# Records assets/demo.gif. Run with `make demo`.
Output assets/demo.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1300
Set Height 400
Set Padding 28
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 30ms

Hide
Type "export PATH=$PWD/bin:$PATH && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "timeline run --repeat 2 https://go.dev https://pkg.go.dev https://api.github.com/zen"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 8s
